{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not delay JVM-fatal failures behind arbitrary cleanup.** After an end hook throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, this loop continues invoking earlier plugins; a blocking hook can prevent the fatal condition from ever escaping. Rethrow JVM-fatal errors immediately, or strictly bound any essential best-effort cleanup.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc772zRp","finding_digest":"c92b7c1747a290739ec238dd4ec3ebca21a44760e63e5f5597374768eeaf7d5f","finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","line":114,"observation_digest":"e661a8b4d6c493e9caf3d8dcda48c3519bd4e0049f99f22462bc21405a723c25","observation_id":"aro_v1_4zq2rngwysj6tsxt3donusgdkg","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","published_at":"2026-10-09T00:19:32Z","review_id":"arr_v1_uced5uhiw626ix4hlrvxazqc34","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"96356e4841da0c2c7d1ca380207d616d4c74239d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":113,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_tqqqgtskof4fhlce5atmfqpk5c","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T00:19:32Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
